	<p>Welcome to my blog! Here, I'll share my thoughts and updates as I work through the Astro tutorial.</p>

	<ul>
		<li><a href="/posts/post-1/">Post 1</a></li>
		<li><a href="/posts/post-2/">Post 2</a></li>
		<li><a href="/posts/post-3/">Post 3</a></li>
	</ul>
</BaseLayout>